  "description": "Patriotic Baby Shower Invitation, 4th of July Baby Shower, USA Baby Boy Party, Red White Blue Baby Shower, American Independence Day Celebration\nCelebrate your little firecracker with this adorable patriotic baby shower design featuring classic red, white, and blue Americana elements. The collection includes a vintage blue pickup truck filled with fireworks, USA letters, patriotic baby bodysuit, ice cream, donuts, stars, bunny ears, baseball cap, balloons, and festive Independence Day decorations.\nPerfect for 4th of July baby showers, patriotic baby boy celebrations, summer parties, American-themed birthdays, invitations, welcome signs, favor tags, stickers, scrapbooking, sublimation projects, greeting cards, and print-on-demand products.\nThis charming watercolor artwork combines vintage Americana style with sweet baby shower details, creating the perfect design for celebrating a future little patriot.",
